cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Awesome Vericoding
message: If you use this list in your work, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: João
    family-names: Galego
repository-code: https://github.com/JGalego/awesome-vericoding
abstract: >-
  A curated list of resources for vericoding: writing programs together with
  machine-checked proofs that they meet a formal specification, either by hand
  (classic vericoding) or with AI models and agents (AI vericoding).
keywords:
  - vericoding
  - formal verification
  - program verification
  - verified code generation
  - theorem proving
  - large language models
  - Dafny
  - Verus
  - Lean
  - Rocq
